# Git 行尾策略 / Line-ending policy
# 仓库内一律以 LF 存储，检出到工作区时由 Git 自行决定（Windows 上通常仍是 CRLF）。
# Everything is stored with LF in the repository; Git decides what the working
# tree gets (on Windows that is usually still CRLF).
* text=auto

# 以下类型按文本处理，便于 diff 与合并
# The following are treated as text so that diffs and merges stay readable.
*.js    text
*.mjs   text
*.css   text
*.html  text
*.json  text
*.md    text

# 二进制资源不做任何转换 / Binary assets must never be converted.
*.ico   binary
*.png   binary
*.exe   binary
*.lnk   binary
